      "name": "ordering.utf16VsCodePoint",
      "category": "ordering",
      "note": "Python's default str sort is by code point. ACJ-1 \u00a72 requires UTF-16 code-unit order. They diverge for supplementary-plane keys. A naive Python canonicalizer would emit different canonical bytes and therefore a different digest.",
